language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Added corners: enter the digits 1 to 8 in the circles (corners) and squares (edge midpoints) of the frame, so that each square equals the sum of its adjoining circles.
find positions : matrix indexed by [int(1..8)] of int(1..8)
such that
$ the digits 1 through 8 are each used once
allDiff(positions),
$ the top square is the sum of the two top circles
positions[2] = positions[1] + positions[3],
$ the left square is the sum of the top-left and bottom-left circles
positions[4] = positions[1] + positions[6],
$ the right square is the sum of the top-right and bottom-right circles
positions[5] = positions[3] + positions[8],
$ the bottom square is the sum of the two bottom circles
positions[7] = positions[6] + positions[8]
